    {
      "ja": "• メカデザイナー海老川兼武氏監修のもと、最大の特徴である太陽炉「GNドライヴ」に着目し、「GN粒子」が全身に伝達していく機構を徹底考証！そこから導きだされたデザインアレンジと内部フレーム構造が具現化されている！",
      "en": "• Under the supervision of mechanical designer Kanetake Ebikawa, we focused on the most distinctive feature of the solar furnace \"GN Drive \" and thoroughly investigated the mechanism by which \" GN particles\" are transmitted throughout the body! The design arrangement and internal frame structure derived from this have been realized!"
